  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test the most impactful design choice: multimodal integration. This configuration tests combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) data with simple concatenation fusion, isolating the effect of multimodal representation. It directly addresses whether combining modalities improves performance, which is central to the study's goal, while keeping other factors minimal to focus on the core hypothesis."
